<!doctype html><html lang="id"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Pemulihan DigitalToko</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f3f5fc;color:#172440;font:16px/1.6 system-ui;display:grid;min-height:100vh;place-items:center}main{max-width:640px;margin:20px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe4ef;border-radius:20px}h1{font-size:26px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{display:inline-block;background:#4f46e5;color:white;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}.state{font-weight:650;color:#4f46e5}</style><main><h1>Pemulihan aplikasi aktif</h1><p id="state" class="state">{{ ['queued'=>'Dalam antrean','processing'=>'Sedang memulihkan','completed'=>'Pemulihan selesai','failed'=>'Perlu pemeriksaan'][$state] ?? $state }}</p><p id="phase">{{ $phase }}</p><p>ID: <code>{{ $id }}</code></p><p>Halaman ini tetap bisa dibuka selama maintenance. Setelah selesai, login menggunakan akun pada snapshot. Worker, scheduler dan bot menunggu tinjauan. Setelah login, buka Backup & pemulihan → Buka kembali layanan.</p><p><a href="/admin/login">Ke login admin</a></p><p>Setelah meninjau transaksi lama, dari apps/web jalankan:</p><code>php artisan digitaltoko:recovery-resume {{ $id }} --reviewed</code></main><script>const initialState=@json($state),labels={queued:'Dalam antrean',processing:'Sedang memulihkan',completed:'Pemulihan selesai',failed:'Perlu pemeriksaan'},state=document.getElementById('state'),phase=document.getElementById('phase');async function update(){try{const r=await fetch(location.href,{headers:{Accept:'application/json'},cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw Error();const d=await r.json();state.textContent=labels[d.state]??d.state;phase.textContent=d.phase;if(!['completed','failed'].includes(d.state))setTimeout(update,3000);}catch{phase.textContent='Status belum dapat dibaca. Periksa proses backup/restore melalui operator.';setTimeout(update,5000);}}if(!['completed','failed'].includes(initialState))update();</script></html>